        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the seven‑layer protective packing mandatory for all items on the Deoghar‑Pakur route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While the full seven‑layer system is recommended for fragile, high‑value, or antique items, we customize packing based on item type. Heavy furniture may use the outer weather shield and structural reinforcement, whereas electronics benefit from the impact‑absorption core. Our pre‑move survey determines the optimal combination to safeguard every shipment.</p>
