        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment live while it travels from Deoghar to Pakur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every Shree Ashirwad container truck is equipped with satellite‑grade GPS that feeds real‑time coordinates to our client portal. You receive instant alerts for geo‑fencing breaches, speed deviations, and estimated arrival times, giving you full visibility throughout the Deoghar‑Pakur transit.</p>
