        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure safe loading and anchorage of vehicles on the Deoghar‑Pakur route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our two‑wheeler carriers feature hydraulic loading ramps, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. For cars and larger vehicles, we use enclosed multi‑car trailers with built‑in anti‑shift braces. Each load is inspected, secured, and documented before departure, guaranteeing zero movement during the 850 km highway transit.</p>
